(text "OR2_N16 testbench (tools/kicad/gen_cf_n16.py; the same netlist and .meas as tools/spice/cf_sweep.py).\n2 us per input state, (A,B) = 00 10 00 01 00 11 10 01 00.\nSTIM_x (HV PWL, ideal) -> divider -> driver inverter (one 6N16B, Ra 10k) -> divider (C1 2.7 pF) -> x (LV DUT input).\nEach DUT output goes straight onto 5 load tubes (both grids on the net) = 10 grids; PLA / PLB = a load plate.\nPlot V(/A) V(/B) V(/YA) V(/PLA). .meas: ya*/pa* = Y and the load plate at the end of each state,\ntplh_*/tphl_* = DUT grid (-5 V) -> Y (-5 V), tqlh_*/tqhl_* = DUT grid (-5 V) -> load plate (100 V), hz_* = the A-down/B-up hazard." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 180.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d1778355-1f56-4b80-b3ce-913768713f80"))
(text ".meas tran ya0 find v(/YA) at=1.95u\n.meas tran ya1 find v(/YA) at=3.95u\n.meas tran ya2 find v(/YA) at=5.95u\n.meas tran ya3 find v(/YA) at=7.95u\n.meas tran ya4 find v(/YA) at=9.95u\n.meas tran ya5 find v(/YA) at=11.95u\n.meas tran ya6 find v(/YA) at=13.95u\n.meas tran ya7 find v(/YA) at=15.95u\n.meas tran ya8 find v(/YA) at=17.95u\n.meas tran pa0 find v(/PLA) at=1.95u\n.meas tran pa1 find v(/PLA) at=3.95u\n.meas tran pa2 find v(/PLA) at=5.95u\n.meas tran pa3 find v(/PLA) at=7.95u\n.meas tran pa4 find v(/PLA) at=9.95u\n.meas tran pa5 find v(/PLA) at=11.95u\n.meas tran pa6 find v(/PLA) at=13.95u\n.meas tran pa7 find v(/PLA) at=15.95u\n.meas tran pa8 find v(/PLA) at=17.95u\n.meas tran ga0 find v(/A) at=1.95u\n.meas tran ga1 find v(/A) at=3.95u\n.meas tran ga2 find v(/A) at=5.95u\n.meas tran ga3 find v(/A) at=7.95u\n.meas tran ga4 find v(/A) at=9.95u\n.meas tran ga5 find v(/A) at=11.95u\n.meas tran ga6 find v(/A) at=13.95u\n.meas tran ga7 find v(/A) at=15.95u\n.meas tran ga8 find v(/A) at=17.95u\n.meas tran amin min v(/A) from=0.5u to=18u\n.meas tran bmin min v(/B) from=0.5u to=18u\n.meas tran ymin min v(/YA) from=0.5u to=18u\n.meas tran tdiv_r trig v(/PDA) val=100 rise=1 td=1.9u targ v(/A) val=-5 rise=1 td=1.9u\n.meas tran tdiv_f trig v(/PDA) val=100 fall=1 td=3.9u targ v(/A) val=-5 fall=1 td=3.9u\n.meas tran hz_y min v(/YA) from=14u to=16u\n.meas tran hz_lp max v(/PLA) from=14u to=16u\n.meas tran hz_t when v(/PLA)=80 fall=last from=14u to=16u\n.meas tran tplh_a2 trig v(/A) val=-5 rise=1 td=1.9u targ v(/YA) val=-5 rise=1 td=1.9u\n.meas tran tqlh_a2 trig v(/A) val=-5 rise=1 td=1.9u targ v(/PLA) val=100 fall=1 td=1.9u\n.meas tran tphl_a4 trig v(/A) val=-5 fall=1 td=3.9u targ v(/YA) val=-5 fall=1 td=3.9u\n.meas tran tqhl_a4 trig v(/A) val=-5 fall=1 td=3.9u targ v(/PLA) val=100 rise=1 td=3.9u\n.meas tran tplh_b6 trig v(/B) val=-5 rise=1 td=5.9u targ v(/YA) val=-5 rise=1 td=5.9u\n.meas tran tqlh_b6 trig v(/B) val=-5 rise=1 td=5.9u targ v(/PLA) val=100 fall=1 td=5.9u\n.meas tran tphl_b8 trig v(/B) val=-5 fall=1 td=7.9u targ v(/YA) val=-5 fall=1 td=7.9u\n.meas tran tqhl_b8 trig v(/B) val=-5 fall=1 td=7.9u targ v(/PLA) val=100 rise=1 td=7.9u\n.meas tran tphl_b16 trig v(/B) val=-5 fall=1 td=15.9u targ v(/YA) val=-5 fall=1 td=15.9u\n.meas tran tqhl_b16 trig v(/B) val=-5 fall=1 td=15.9u targ v(/PLA) val=100 rise=1 td=15.9u" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "824c2afe-2760-4ba0-837a-2f15ddbb3644"))
